rows.en:
"...But it's calling me.
It called me, so I have to go to it..."
If we hadn't been there, I'm sure he would have thrown himself into the incinerator.{p}

...Thank you.
If you'd been in my position then, I'm sure you'd have done the same.
With Kanai watching over me, I hurriedly packed my things into my bag.{p}

...I see. So you want to hear it.
Curiosity is all well and good, but...
If you say you want to hear it, then I'll tell you.{p}

No one suspected me in Kanai's death.
All the teachers knew the doll story, after all.
Everyone settled on the conclusion that Kanai died of a heart attack.{p}
